%
(Program to test M70 save/M72 restore context)
(M. Haberler)

o<print_debug> sub
(debug, tool offset active = #<_tool_offset>)
o<print_debug> endsub

o1000 sub
(begin sub)
o1001 if [#1 GT 0]
      M70 (save context)
o1001 endif
G49
/G43 H0101 (Add wear offsets)
G49
G0 X5 Z1
o1002 if [#1 GT 0]
      M72 (restore context)
o1002 endif
o1000 endsub

G90 G54 G20
G49
T01 (Just geometry offsets for tool 1)
G53 G0 X0 Y0 Z0
G0 X2 Z1
G0 X3 Z0
o1000 call [1.0]
(expect restored context here)
o<print_debug> call
G0 X-5 Z1
T01 (Just geometry offsets for tool 1)
o1000 call [0.0]
(expect to keep state from o1000 sub)
o<print_debug> call
%
